Package: gteatime
Version: 1.0.3-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: J. A. Corbal <jacorbal@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 76
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.32.0), libgtk-3-0t64 (>= 3.21.5), libx11-6
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jacorbal/gteatime
Description: lightweight GTK3 system-tray tea and coffee timer
 GTK3 tray timer for tea and coffee presets written in C inspired by
 kteatime.  It uses StatusNotifierItem over D-Bus when available and
 falls back to the XEmbed system tray protocol on X11.
